WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:06.170
Finding the right creator shouldn't mean five hundred open tabs. This is ScoutBlack.

00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:12.027
Creators sign in with Google and claim their YouTube channel. It's free, always.

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:18.293
Read-only YouTube access proves it's your channel, and brings in your verified audience.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:24.400
Pick what you make, your languages, and your rates, with a market guide for your reach.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:30.900
Brands can now find you. See your niche rank, the briefs you match, and who to pitch.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:38.040
When an offer arrives, reply, counter, or accept. Then run the deal on a board.

00:00:38.533 --> 00:00:41.173
For brands and agencies.

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:45.237
Brands sign in, set up a profile and a first brief.

00:00:45.237 --> 00:00:48.387
Every plan starts with a four-day free trial.

00:00:48.883 --> 00:00:51.730
Describe your campaign in plain English.

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:57.851
ScoutBlack ranks creators on engagement, growth, reach, authenticity and track record.

00:00:57.851 --> 00:00:59.203
Not follower count.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:02.438
Open any creator to see why they ranked.

00:01:02.438 --> 00:01:06.340
Shortlist up to four, and compare, even audience overlap.

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:12.833
Creators on ScoutBlack receive offers directly. Pick a template, set the fee, send.

00:01:13.333 --> 00:01:15.921
Track every deal from inbound to paid.

00:01:15.921 --> 00:01:21.573
Posts file into campaigns automatically, and share of voice shows how you stack up.

00:01:22.067 --> 00:01:27.907
Free for creators. A four-day free trial for brands. ScoutBlack dot in.
